{"id":"n83306-1-10","stage":4,"title":"내막 · 内幕","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83306-1-10-1","ko":"그렇게 사이가 좋던 두 사람이 어쩌다가 헤어졌대?","zh":"听说原本关系那么好的那两个人，不知怎么就分手了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"사이가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이가","audio":"/audio/8b5241ee7621e689c609.mp3"}},{"text":"좋던","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋던","audio":"/audio/fae4021a2164117962ea.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌다가","meaning":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다가：“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91976","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어졌대?","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어졌대","audio":"/audio/d392891975bec208b0e6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，亲，和睦，美满","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"相互亲近、亲密。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"f173c7431a0ab9ee","term":"어쩌다가","zh":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3","entryId":"91976","definition":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5e543ef6ca27c79e1c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83306-1-10-2","ko":"글쎄요, 저도 그 내막은 잘 모르겠어요.","zh":"唉，我也不太清楚其中的缘由。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}},{"text":"저도","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저도","audio":"/audio/2e274ebad4675928ad87.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"내막은","meaning":"内幕","explanation":"내막：内幕；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내막","audio":"/audio/94818e6ecfffe97ed2aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83306","senseId":"1","lemma":"내막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내막은","audio":"/audio/13b010800b0ae5ab7194.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef